### P1-3: Update Gallery with Accordion Groups

**Status**: Not Started
**Effort**: Medium (3-5 days)
**Dependencies**: None (can parallel with other work)
**Spec Reference**: index.html (current gallery structure) • **Status Reference**: Research decision: "Hybrid accordion groups + expandable cards"

#### Description
Replace the current always-expanded gallery with collapsible accordion sections grouped by technique. Each of the 10 technique sections should be independently collapsible. Maintains current visual design but adds interactivity.

**Current Structure** (index.html lines 254-852):
- 10 `.technique-section` divs, always visible
- Each section contains 2 `.animation-row` (logo + text)
- Each row contains 3 `.animation-card` (base, varied, procedural)

**Target Structure**:
