- Sections collapsed by default (or first expanded)
- Smooth expand/collapse transitions
- Visual indicator (chevron/arrow) for expand state
- Preserve all existing card styling and layout

#### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] All 10 technique sections are collapsible accordions
- [ ] Click technique title to toggle expand/collapse
- [ ] Visual indicator (chevron) rotates with state
- [ ] Smooth height transition (300-400ms ease)
- [ ] First section expanded by default, others collapsed
- [ ] Preserve all existing card hover effects and styling
- [ ] Mobile responsive (accordion works on all screen sizes)
- [ ] Keyboard accessible (Enter/Space to toggle)
- [ ] URL hash support: `index.html#technique-03` auto-expands section 3

#### Technical Notes
- **Implementation approach**: Pure CSS + minimal JavaScript (no framework needed)
- **HTML changes**:
  ```html
  <div class="technique-section" data-technique="01">
      <h2 class="technique-title accordion-header" onclick="toggleSection(this)">
          <span>...</span>
          <svg class="chevron">...</svg>
      </h2>
      <div class="technique-content" style="max-height: 0;">
          <!-- existing rows -->
      </div>
  </div>
  ```
- **CSS transitions**:
  ```css
  .technique-content {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }
  .technique-section.expanded .technique-content {
      max-height: 2000px; /* Large enough for content */
  }
  .chevron {
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .expanded .chevron {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  ```
- **JavaScript**:
  ```javascript
  function toggleSection(header) {
      const section = header.closest('.technique-section');
      section.classList.toggle('expanded');
  }
  // Init: expand first section, handle URL hash
  ```

