### P3-5: Add Gallery Search/Filter

**Status**: Not Started
**Effort**: Small (1-2 days)
**Dependencies**: P1-3 (accordion structure)
**Spec Reference**: index.html (gallery structure) • **Status Reference**: Not mentioned in STATUS (nice-to-have enhancement)

#### Description
Add search/filter input to gallery for quickly finding specific animations. Useful when gallery has 60 items across 10 sections.

**Features**:
- Search box at top of gallery (below legend)
- Real-time filtering as user types
- Match against: technique name, animation type (logo/text), variation (base/varied/procedural)
- Auto-expand sections with matches, collapse sections with no matches
- Clear button to reset filter

#### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Search input added to gallery header
- [ ] Typing filters cards in real-time (no submit button needed)
- [ ] Matching cards remain visible, non-matching cards hidden (or grayed out)
- [ ] Sections with matches auto-expand
- [ ] Sections with zero matches collapse
- [ ] Clear button (X icon) resets filter and collapses all sections
- [ ] Case-insensitive search
- [ ] Minimum 2 characters to activate search (avoid filtering on single char)
- [ ] Keyboard accessible (Escape to clear)

#### Technical Notes
- **HTML**:
  ```html
  <div class="search-container">
      <input type="text" id="gallery-search" placeholder="Search animations..." />
      <button class="clear-search" onclick="clearSearch()">×</button>
  </div>
  ```
- **JavaScript**:
  ```javascript
  const searchInput = document.getElementById('gallery-search');
  searchInput.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
      const query = e.target.value.toLowerCase();
      if (query.length < 2) { resetFilter(); return; }

      document.querySelectorAll('.animation-card').forEach(card => {
          const text = card.textContent.toLowerCase();
          card.style.display = text.includes(query) ? 'block' : 'none';
      });

      // Expand sections with visible cards
      document.querySelectorAll('.technique-section').forEach(section => {
          const visibleCards = section.querySelectorAll('.animation-card[style*="display: block"]');
          section.classList.toggle('expanded', visibleCards.length > 0);
      });
  });
  ```
- **Styling**: Minimal - reuse existing input styles, add subtle focus state

